MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=0
RELEASE_VERSION=0
PRERELEASE=1
DEV_VERSION=4
DESCRIPTION=CI: versioning job runs gen_version_def.sh after relocate and pushes userland/shell/version_def.h when it differs from the branch (same-repo pushes only; develop/main skip push like entry relocate — Version lock on merge still publishes). Contributors need not hand-commit the header for VERSION_LINE-only .ver edits on feature branches. Policy: omit hand-authored RELEASE_DATE= lines from new preproduction *.ver (relocate / Version lock append); version/entries and version/locked ABOUT.txt updated to say the same.
